# Typecheck after edits

This app is React. The strict check is `bun run typecheck` (`tsc --noEmit`).

After changing TypeScript or TSX, run `bun run typecheck` and fix errors before finishing.

Keep these flags on in `config/tsconfig.base.json`: `strict`, `noUncheckedIndexedAccess`, `exactOptionalPropertyTypes`, `noImplicitOverride`.
